// Lily# feedback #20 (docs/repro/lilysharp-feedback-2026-10-04.md): after a change to a longer
// meter (4/4 -> 12/8), the upper voice's notes past the old bar length (from the 9th eighth) are
// drawn with their stems down, and the lower voice's last c'4. is not drawn. With 12/8 from the
// start both voices are drawn right.
title "voice stems 4/4 to 12/8"
octave absolute
time 4/4
key c major
part rh { clef treble }
section Piece {
  rh {
    voice { c'''8 d'''8 e'''8 f'''8 g'''8 a'''8 b'''8 a'''8 } { c''2 c''2 } |
    time 12/8 voice { c'''8 d'''8 e'''8 f'''8 g'''8 a'''8 b'''8 a'''8 g'''8 f'''8 e'''8 d'''8 } { c''4. c''4. c''4. c''4. } |
  }
}
form main { ~Piece }
score main {
  staff rh "Piano"
}
